$\downarrow$ \textit{internal swap}\\[2pt]
\textcolor{red!65!black}{\textbf{perturbed form}}: ``trasnfer money today''\\[2pt]
$\Rightarrow$ \textbf{unchanged intent}: money transfer
\end{minipage}}
\caption{A clean utterance and its internal-swap variant preserve the intent but expose different word features. The unchanged intent motivates measuring operator footprints before allocating augmentation.}
\label{fig:motivation}
